// Real fighting companions -- see summon_fey.ron for the shared shape notes
// (`alignment`/`with_agent`/`incorporeal`/`phantom_illusion` all left at
// their real-companion defaults, `meta.cooldown` added deliberately since
// this variant has no `energy_cost` field).
//
// No dedicated "demon"/"fiend" species exists anywhere in the engine
// (checked every species list in
// common/src/comp/body/{biped_small,biped_large}.rs, plus
// quadruped_low.rs's reptilian/beast roster -- zero demon/fiend-themed
// entries). `Ashen` (`BipedSmall`) is reused as the closest available
// brimstone/infernal-flavored species with its own real combat loadout
// preset (`AshenSummon`, see custom/gigas_fire/ashen_summons.ron), standing
// in for "minor fiends... from the churning chaos beyond".
//
// The sheet's own description is explicitly plural ("a pack of minor
// fiends... the summoned horde"), unlike summon_fey.ron/
// summon_shadowspawn.ron's singular phrasing -- `summoned_amount: 3` reflects
// that difference rather than defaulting every `BasicSummon` spell in this
// batch to 1, with the cooldown raised accordingly for the extra companions.
BasicSummon(
    buildup_duration: 1.0,
    cast_duration: 0.7,
    recover_duration: 0.6,
    summon_info: Npc(
        summoned_amount: 3,
        summon_distance: (2.0, 4.0),
        body: BipedSmall((species: Ashen, body_type: Male)),
        scale: None,
        has_health: true,
        use_npc_name: true,
        loadout_config: Some(AshenSummon),
        skillset_config: Some(Rank5),
        duration: Some((secs: 60, nanos: 0)),
    ),
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Arcane), cooldown: Some(55.0)),
)
